{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33024","headline":"故人寄茶 · 曹邺","name":"故人寄茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剑外九华英，缄题下玉京。\n开时微月上，碾处乱泉声。\n半夜招僧至，孤吟对月烹。\n碧沈霞脚碎，香泛乳花轻。\n六腑睡神去，数朝诗思清。\n月余不敢费，留伴肘书行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}